{"id": "65532", "title": "代孕夫", "author": "萝卜兔子", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 22, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65532.htm", "intro": "王殷成六年前为了给自己的爱人还债，为别人代孕生下一个孩子。\r\n六年后他为了工作只身飞往H市的时候，意外在机场遇到了曾经的恋人，那个男人如今不但活得风光滋润，还有一个高富帅的总裁男友。\r\n然而让王殷成没有想到的是，那个冷漠总裁六岁的儿子，竟与自己有七分神似。\r\n\r\n总之这是一个：小包子找爸爸+前?渣攻踹了总裁男友想吃回头草+总裁恋上代孕夫……的狗血故事\r\n\r\n文内有小包子，暂时无生子情节（因为已经生完了一个了），是作者呕心沥血（？？）之作。\r\n\r\n包子、狗血、总裁、高干、前?渣?攻、回头草、贱／人……【关键字太多】，看文请自带避雷针，谢谢！！\r\n\r\n\r\n内容标签：生子 春风一度 婚恋 都市情缘", "base": "files/article/html/65/65532", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9751128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9751129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9751131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-21", "file": "9751133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "VIP章节 1", "file": "9751135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9751137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9751139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9751140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9751141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9751142.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "9751145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "9751147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "9751155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "9751157.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "9751160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "9751162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9751164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9751166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9751169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9751171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9751173.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外完", "file": "9751175.html", "available": false}]}